<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Hydromet half year loss A$15.85 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Hydromet half year loss A$15.85 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		   (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating			 loss 15.85 vs loss 7.76</p>
<p>    Net				 loss 15.85 vs loss 7.90</p>
<p>    Dividend				  nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales				    3.98 vs  4.12</p>
<p>    Other income			   0.45 vs  0.64</p>
<p>    Abnormal			 loss 11.51 vs loss 6.03</p>
<p>    Tax					nil  vs 0.14</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.06 vs 0.05</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   0.83 vs 0.39</p>
<p>    Minorities				nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Hydromet Corp Ltd provides hydrometallurgical processing technology to the industrial recycling industry for producing chemical products from industrial residue. Abnormal loss includes general provision of A$10 million against possible diminution in value of non-current assets.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
